8aeb0048:  .;
 .;This routine is designed to process admissions and associate them
 .;with standard deficiencies for the IRT (Incomplete Records Tracking) system.
 .;

acff3282:  .;
 .;The AUTO entry point is designed to automatically run the process
 .;for the last two days and the current day to ensure that all
 .;admissions are up-to-date with their standard deficiencies.
 .;

e167db59:  ;
 ;SETSTR is a function to insert a string S into another string V.
 ;It starts at position X in the string V and inserts S for L characters.
 ;If S is shorter than L, the rest of the space is filled with spaces.
 ;After inserting, the rest of V continues unchanged.
 ;
